1
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:14,431
ERRONKA

2
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:21,604
<i>Ranma, saotometarren
arte martzialen eskolakoa.</i>

3
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,857
<i>Eta Akane, Tendô dojokoa.</i>

4
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:27,610
<i>Senar-emaztegaiak dira
euren gurasoek erabakita.</i>

5
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:29,571
<i>Zuk ezin duzu hori erabaki!</i>

6
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:31,072
<i>Hau amorrua.</i>

7
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:34,284
<i>Eta Ranmak arazotxo bat du.</i>

8
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:36,578
<i>Zer arraio ari zara?</i>

9
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,290
<i>Urez busti eta neska bihurtzen da.</i>

10
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:41,958
ITSUSIA

11
00:02:12,882 --> 00:02:17,095
{\an8}TSUBASA KURENAI ERASORA!

12
00:02:21,015 --> 00:02:24,519
"Laster zure bizia kentzera joango naiz".

13
00:02:24,602 --> 00:02:26,479
Tsubasa Kurenai?

14
00:02:27,063 --> 00:02:28,398
Erronka berri bat?

15
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:35,029
Tsubasa Kurenai delako bat ezagutzen dut?

16
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:38,408
Lapurreta egin duzu? Ezkontza-iruzurra?

17
00:02:38,491 --> 00:02:39,492
Aizu.

18
00:02:39,576 --> 00:02:42,162
Prestatu, Ranma Saotome!

19
00:02:54,799 --> 00:02:57,218
- Gutun…
- Ontzia?

20
00:02:58,678 --> 00:03:00,180
{\an8}POSTA

21
00:03:02,765 --> 00:03:05,143
Eraso!

22
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:12,233
- Zer demontre?
- Ranma.

23
00:03:12,317 --> 00:03:14,694
Zer egin diozu gutunontziari?

24
00:03:14,777 --> 00:03:17,155
Ez dut gogoan
postontzi batekin etsaitu izana!

25
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:20,575
Eraso!

26
00:03:50,939 --> 00:03:52,106
Neska bat?

27
00:03:53,650 --> 00:03:55,068
Ranma…

28
00:03:59,572 --> 00:04:02,575
Eraso…

29
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,915
Nor da?

30
00:04:12,418 --> 00:04:17,340
- Ez dakit.
- Zure emaztegairen bat?

31
00:04:17,423 --> 00:04:19,842
Zer zabiltzate errepide erdian?

32
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:21,135
Ukyô.

33
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:25,306
Ukyô… maitea…

34
00:04:27,308 --> 00:04:29,477
Tsubasa Kurenai?

35
00:04:31,854 --> 00:04:33,064
ERRONKA

36
00:04:33,147 --> 00:04:35,149
<i>Erronka bidali duen pertsona.</i>

37
00:04:35,233 --> 00:04:37,235
Ezagutzen duzu?

38
00:04:37,318 --> 00:04:40,947
Sartu hemen. Bota zakarrontzira. Agur!

39
00:04:43,449 --> 00:04:46,744
Arraioa. Sinestea ere!
Tsubasak honaino jarraitu nau.

40
00:04:46,828 --> 00:04:48,329
Nor zen ba?

41
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:53,584
Tsubasa
nire lehengo institutuko gelakidea zen.

42
00:04:53,668 --> 00:04:54,752
Baina orduan…

43
00:04:54,836 --> 00:04:56,921
Zergatik jo dit niri erronka?

44
00:04:57,005 --> 00:04:59,590
Gogoratzen mutil plantak egiten nituela?

45
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,592
<i>Ba kontua da…</i>

46
00:05:01,676 --> 00:05:02,885
Ene Ukyô maitea.

47
00:05:03,678 --> 00:05:04,679
Maite zaitut.

48
00:05:04,762 --> 00:05:08,599
Tsubasa. Ez dakit hau nola esan, baina…

49
00:05:08,683 --> 00:05:12,145
Badaukat emaztegaia.

50
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:16,274
<i>Badaukat emaztegaia.</i>

51
00:05:16,357 --> 00:05:19,694
<i>Emaztegaia…</i>

52
00:05:22,613 --> 00:05:25,408
Halere, Tsubasak ez zuen amore eman.

53
00:05:25,491 --> 00:05:27,869
Ene Ukyô institutuz aldatu arren,

54
00:05:28,453 --> 00:05:31,873
amodio gutunak idazten nizkion.

55
00:05:31,956 --> 00:05:34,834
Tematia zinen gero.

56
00:05:34,917 --> 00:05:38,838
Apurtzeko, gutun bat bidali nion
Ranmaren argazki batekin.

57
00:05:38,921 --> 00:05:41,174
Ai, ai, ai…

58
00:05:41,924 --> 00:05:44,093
Zer argazki mota bidali zenion?

59
00:05:44,177 --> 00:05:46,929
- Neska itxurarekin, noski.
- Zergatik?

60
00:05:47,013 --> 00:05:51,351
Tsubasak mutila naizela uste du.
Nahasgarria litzateke senargaia izatea.

61
00:05:57,607 --> 00:05:59,275
Zer?

62
00:05:59,359 --> 00:06:00,360
Neska itsusia.

63
00:06:00,443 --> 00:06:03,321
<i>Itsusia…</i>

64
00:06:03,946 --> 00:06:05,823
Ranma?

65
00:06:06,657 --> 00:06:08,576
Zure sentimenduak mindu ditu?

66
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,579
Ene Ukyô maitea!

67
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:16,250
Eta nork galdu zuen
neska itsusi honen kontra?

68
00:06:18,336 --> 00:06:20,129
Horrelakoa da bizitza.

69
00:06:20,213 --> 00:06:22,131
Beraz, etsi eta zoaz etxera.

70
00:06:22,215 --> 00:06:23,800
Ikusiko duzu!

71
00:06:26,469 --> 00:06:27,845
Pasatu egin zarete.

72
00:06:27,929 --> 00:06:30,640
Ez, horrek argi utziko dio dena.

73
00:06:31,599 --> 00:06:34,894
Eraso!

74
00:06:42,902 --> 00:06:44,570
Kaka. Huts egin dut.

75
00:06:44,654 --> 00:06:48,282
Tsubasa…

76
00:06:48,366 --> 00:06:51,202
Xerra erre bihurtuko zaitut!

77
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:55,123
Itxaron. Tsubasa, begira.

78
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,376
Zertan ari zara?

79
00:06:59,127 --> 00:07:02,380
Ulertu duzu? Ukyô neska bat da.

80
00:07:02,463 --> 00:07:04,298
Neska bat.

81
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:07,593
KONPONDUTA

82
00:07:07,677 --> 00:07:09,929
Hasieratik hori egin izan bazenu…

83
00:07:10,012 --> 00:07:11,097
Egia.

84
00:07:12,098 --> 00:07:14,517
Nire Ukyô maitea neska da

85
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,436
eta betidanik jakin dut.

86
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:22,900
Ulertzen?
Emakumeak besterik ez zaizkit gustatzen.

87
00:07:23,526 --> 00:07:26,195
Ukyô lapurtuko dizut.

88
00:07:29,782 --> 00:07:30,908
Neska itsusia.

89
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:31,993
KONPONDU GABE

90
00:07:32,076 --> 00:07:34,287
Tsubasak neskak gogoko ditu?

91
00:07:34,787 --> 00:07:36,414
Egundokoa.

92
00:07:36,497 --> 00:07:40,168
Nola ausartzen da…

93
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:44,547
- Egun on.
- Kaixo.

94
00:07:45,381 --> 00:07:48,301
Eraso!

95
00:07:50,094 --> 00:07:52,263
Zein zitala, ene Ukyô maitea.

96
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:55,725
A zer neska polita!

97
00:07:55,808 --> 00:07:59,103
Nire atzetik ibiltzeari uzteko
esan dizut, Tsubasa.

98
00:08:00,938 --> 00:08:02,190
Tsubasa Kurenai da.

99
00:08:02,273 --> 00:08:05,943
Ez duzu ulertzen ala?
Ranma eta ni ezkongaiak gara.

100
00:08:06,027 --> 00:08:09,780
Neska itsusi hura?
Nola izango da ba zure emaztegaia?

101
00:08:09,864 --> 00:08:12,366
Ranma mutil…

102
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:14,660
Egun on, Tsubasa.

103
00:08:14,744 --> 00:08:16,412
Neska itsusia da!

104
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:18,331
Zer nahi duzu, ergel biolentoa?

105
00:08:20,917 --> 00:08:25,546
Lehiatu egingo gara
Ukyôrentzat egokiena nor den ikusteko.

106
00:08:26,297 --> 00:08:27,465
Zer da hori?

107
00:08:27,548 --> 00:08:30,676
- Zer? Bazkaltzeko…
- Okonomiyaki postu bat?

108
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,970
- Postu bat?
- Zer da hau?

109
00:08:33,054 --> 00:08:36,557
Okonomiyaki gehien
saltzen dituena, irabazle. Ados?

110
00:08:36,641 --> 00:08:37,934
Dibertigarria dirudi.

111
00:08:38,768 --> 00:08:41,020
Galdetu gabe panfletoak egin dituzu?

112
00:08:41,562 --> 00:08:45,149
- Diru pila irabaziko dut!
- Pozten nau lagundu izanak.

113
00:08:46,526 --> 00:08:49,403
Bai! Bazkaltzeko ordua da!

114
00:08:49,987 --> 00:08:52,073
Aspaldiko, jaun-andreok.

115
00:08:52,156 --> 00:08:56,536
Fûrinkan Institutuko
kazetaritza taldea gara. Begira horri!

116
00:08:56,619 --> 00:08:57,620
UKIREN POSTUA

117
00:08:57,703 --> 00:09:01,374
Bat-bateko ekitaldi honetan
sabela eta bihotza lehiatuko dira.

118
00:09:01,457 --> 00:09:04,502
Ukiren okonomiyakien
salmenta txapelketa da.

119
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:08,506
Ni, Ichiro, kazetaritza taldekoa,
komentarista lanean arituko naiz.

120
00:09:08,589 --> 00:09:13,010
Ukyô Kuonjiren maitasuna lortzeko
bi partaide ditugu borrokan.

121
00:09:13,678 --> 00:09:17,515
Fûrinkan Institutuko bazter-nahaslea:
Ranma Saotome.

122
00:09:17,598 --> 00:09:19,600
Ez egin negar galtzen duzunean.

123
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:24,397
Eta maitasunaren zale amorratu,
baina obsesionatua: Tsubasa Kurenai!

124
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,607
Nork galduko du zure kontra, itsusi?

125
00:09:27,608 --> 00:09:29,026
Arau bakarra dago.

126
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:32,488
Okonomiyaki gehien
saltzen dituena, garaile.

127
00:09:32,572 --> 00:09:35,950
Maitasun eta pasioaren
behin-betiko proba. Azkar, erosi!

128
00:09:36,033 --> 00:09:39,620
Plantxaren maisuak,
lehiaketa hau piztu duen txinpartak,

129
00:09:39,704 --> 00:09:43,457
Ukyô Kuonjik emango dio hasiera
konbate gori-gori honi.

130
00:09:43,541 --> 00:09:46,377
Ukiren okonomiyakien Fûrinkaneko postua

131
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:47,795
irekita dago!

132
00:09:47,878 --> 00:09:49,547
Ez dut bere kontra galduko.

133
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:51,257
Eraso!

134
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:53,718
{\an8}Diru pila irabazi ezazue, konforme?

135
00:09:53,801 --> 00:09:57,054
Tsubasak neskak bakarrik
gogoko dituela entzun dut.

136
00:09:57,138 --> 00:09:58,973
Horregatik gustatzen zaio Ukyô?

137
00:09:59,056 --> 00:10:01,976
<i>Zergatik ari ote da Ranma hain serio?</i>

138
00:10:02,768 --> 00:10:06,731
<i>Nire edertasunari esker dena saldu
eta ez dit berriz itsusi deituko.</i>

139
00:10:06,814 --> 00:10:08,899
Bazkaltzeko ordua dute borrokaleku!

140
00:10:08,983 --> 00:10:10,651
Saltsa-usainak erakarriak,

141
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:13,988
horra doaz mutilak
bazkaria eta nesken bihotza lortzera!

142
00:10:14,071 --> 00:10:16,365
- Eman okonomiyakiak.
- Niri ere bai.

143
00:10:16,449 --> 00:10:17,742
Ongi etorri!

144
00:10:17,825 --> 00:10:19,827
Erosi neska politenari, bale?

145
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:23,331
Maitasun suharra! Egoen arteko talka!

146
00:10:23,414 --> 00:10:26,375
Nork egingo du barre amaieran?

147
00:10:36,302 --> 00:10:39,889
Badugu irabazlea!
Kurenaik erabateko garaipena lortu du!

148
00:10:39,972 --> 00:10:41,766
Dena saldu du.
Amodioan ez du parekorik!

149
00:10:41,849 --> 00:10:46,145
Ranma Saotomek, ordea,
ez du bakar bat ere saldu!

150
00:10:46,228 --> 00:10:47,688
Bai zera…

151
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:50,358
Argi geratu da, itsusi.

152
00:10:50,441 --> 00:10:52,693
Orain Ukyô neurea da.

153
00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:54,445
Ondo merezia duzu.

154
00:10:54,528 --> 00:10:57,073
Tsubasa Kurenai,
mesedez, galderatxo batzuk!

155
00:10:57,657 --> 00:10:59,742
Ziur nengoen irabaziko nuela.

156
00:11:00,326 --> 00:11:02,328
Itsusia naiz?

157
00:11:02,411 --> 00:11:04,747
Zer diozu? Oso polita zara.

158
00:11:04,830 --> 00:11:07,249
Ai, mototsdun neska, zein polita zaren!

159
00:11:07,333 --> 00:11:08,501
Ospa!

160
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:13,964
Ranmaren benetako itxura
ezagutzen ez duen bakarra…

161
00:11:14,048 --> 00:11:16,342
Kunô da, ez?

162
00:11:16,425 --> 00:11:17,426
A bai?

163
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:21,138
Bai. Hemen ezin zenuen irabazi
benetako neska baten aurka.

164
00:11:23,516 --> 00:11:25,518
Orain bai, benetako lehia hasi da.

165
00:11:26,018 --> 00:11:27,937
Ikusiko duzu!

166
00:11:32,066 --> 00:11:36,028
Okonomiyaki goxoak denontzat!

167
00:11:36,112 --> 00:11:38,948
- A zer neska katxarroa.
- Untxiz mozorrotua?

168
00:11:39,031 --> 00:11:40,991
- Nik bat nahi dut!
- Nik ere bai!

169
00:11:41,701 --> 00:11:43,119
{\an8}Eskerrik asko!

170
00:11:43,202 --> 00:11:45,413
{\an8}GUZTIRA SALDUTA

171
00:11:45,496 --> 00:11:49,333
<i>Mozorro bikaina da. Ez da inor konturatu.</i>

172
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:53,087
- Eman bi!
- Niri hiru.

173
00:11:53,170 --> 00:11:55,381
- Hamar, eta zita bat!
- Niri ere bai!

174
00:11:55,464 --> 00:11:56,716
Ai, hau poza!

175
00:11:59,343 --> 00:12:02,638
Zertan zabiltza? Bakarra gelditzen zait.

176
00:12:02,722 --> 00:12:04,432
Zatoz hona, demontre.

177
00:12:05,349 --> 00:12:06,934
RANMA

178
00:12:08,602 --> 00:12:11,731
Zer du ba ona mutilekin asko ligatzeak?

179
00:12:11,814 --> 00:12:14,275
Ixo. Lehiaketa bat da.

180
00:12:14,358 --> 00:12:17,403
Nork erosiko dit azkena?

181
00:12:17,486 --> 00:12:18,529
Aski da!

182
00:12:19,739 --> 00:12:21,657
Banekien irabaziko nuela.

183
00:12:22,616 --> 00:12:24,952
Orain Ukyô neurea da.

184
00:12:25,035 --> 00:12:26,036
Geldi hor.

185
00:12:32,918 --> 00:12:35,588
Azken okonomiyakia, nik erosiko dut.

186
00:12:37,339 --> 00:12:39,759
- Uki!
- Ene Ukyô maitea.

187
00:12:40,885 --> 00:12:42,720
Txapelketa amaitu da.

188
00:12:42,803 --> 00:12:46,223
Lastima. Irabazten ari nintzen.

189
00:12:48,142 --> 00:12:51,896
Ez bazenuen nirekin irten nahi,

190
00:12:51,979 --> 00:12:55,107
hasieratik esatea zenuen!

191
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:57,401
Esan nizun ba!

192
00:12:58,611 --> 00:13:01,739
Ulertzen dut. Akabo ba.

193
00:13:02,281 --> 00:13:05,409
Ukyôrengatik sentitzen dudana
alde batera utziko dut.

194
00:13:10,122 --> 00:13:11,207
Agur!

195
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,375
<i>Tsubasa…</i>

196
00:13:16,337 --> 00:13:18,130
- Ranma?
- Ranma?

197
00:13:25,846 --> 00:13:28,766
{\an8}PARKEA

198
00:13:30,810 --> 00:13:31,894
Tsubasa.

199
00:13:33,312 --> 00:13:36,607
Gorroto dut onartzea,
baina lehiaketa zuk irabazi duzu.

200
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,944
Egia esan, ez zara… itsusia.

201
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:44,657
Hain polita zara, zapaldu nahi zintudala.

202
00:13:45,783 --> 00:13:48,577
Barkatu, pertsona higuingarria naiz.

203
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:52,623
Nola ez nau ba Ukyôk gorrotatuko?

204
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:55,793
<i>Uste dut arazoa ez dela hori.</i>

205
00:13:57,211 --> 00:13:59,171
Dena den, oso polita zara.

206
00:13:59,672 --> 00:14:01,715
Norbait hobeagoa aurkituko duzu.

207
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:07,012
Zer darabilzu buruan?

208
00:14:07,096 --> 00:14:09,515
Nire amodio berria, uste dut…

209
00:14:09,598 --> 00:14:11,767
Eraso!

210
00:14:11,851 --> 00:14:15,020
- Ez, hori ez!
- Eraso!

211
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:17,940
Tsubasa azkar errekuperatu da.

212
00:14:18,023 --> 00:14:20,276
Edozein neskaz maitemintzen da?

213
00:14:20,359 --> 00:14:25,281
Baina gaizki pasatuko du
Ranmaren sekretua jakiten badu.

214
00:14:25,364 --> 00:14:28,993
Nolanahi ere, sufritu egingo du.

215
00:14:35,666 --> 00:14:37,042
Zer gertatzen da?

216
00:14:37,126 --> 00:14:41,005
Zergatik? Nolatan? Zer arraio?

217
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:46,051
Eraso!

218
00:14:46,135 --> 00:14:49,138
Utzi bakean!

219
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,693
Berriz ihes egin du.

220
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:06,822
Ene Ranma hainbeste maite dudan arren…

221
00:15:07,865 --> 00:15:11,201
Nitaz zer ez zaizu gustatzen ba?

222
00:15:11,285 --> 00:15:14,038
Gauza asko, ziur aski.

223
00:15:14,914 --> 00:15:16,040
Tsubasa.

224
00:15:19,376 --> 00:15:21,337
Zer arraio gertatzen zaio?

225
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:24,006
Oso obsesiboa da maiteminduta dagoenean.

226
00:15:24,089 --> 00:15:25,507
Uki.

227
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:28,469
Beldurrik gabe, emaiozu pare bat zartako.

228
00:15:28,552 --> 00:15:31,847
<i>Ez diot neska bati joko.</i>

229
00:15:31,931 --> 00:15:33,974
<i>Tsubasaz libratzeko
moduren bat egon behar du.</i>

230
00:15:34,808 --> 00:15:38,354
Ranma bezalako txoro batez
ahaztu behar zenuke

231
00:15:38,437 --> 00:15:40,648
eta beste norbaitekin maitemindu.

232
00:15:40,731 --> 00:15:45,277
Mutil askok uste dute polita zarela.

233
00:15:45,361 --> 00:15:47,529
Ez, gizonak gorroto ditut.

234
00:15:47,613 --> 00:15:49,740
Halere, Ranmaz ahaztu behar zenuke.

235
00:15:50,324 --> 00:15:51,575
Zergatik?

236
00:15:51,659 --> 00:15:53,452
Zergatik? Ba…

237
00:15:54,411 --> 00:15:56,288
Ez esan ba…

238
00:15:56,789 --> 00:15:59,166
ene Ranma maite duzula?

239
00:15:59,875 --> 00:16:02,252
Nork maiteko luke txoro hori?

240
00:16:02,336 --> 00:16:04,672
A, bale. Hau ezustekoa.

241
00:16:04,755 --> 00:16:07,633
Zutaz kezkaturik nago.

242
00:16:08,175 --> 00:16:09,510
Zer?

243
00:16:18,268 --> 00:16:20,896
Akane, zein maitagarria zaren.

244
00:16:21,438 --> 00:16:23,440
- Utzi.
- Ez dut nahi.

245
00:16:23,524 --> 00:16:24,817
Mesedez!

246
00:16:25,609 --> 00:16:26,694
Gutun bat?

247
00:16:27,903 --> 00:16:32,992
<i>Tsubasa maitea: Igandean
zain izango nauzu parkean. Ranma.</i>

248
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:48,424
Ranmak bidali zuen?

249
00:16:48,507 --> 00:16:52,428
Bai, Tsubasari zita bat eskatu dio.

250
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:56,348
Horrek esan nahi du
Ranmari Tsubasa gustatzen zaiola, ez?

251
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:57,433
Bai zera.

252
00:16:57,516 --> 00:16:59,435
Tsubasa.

253
00:17:00,394 --> 00:17:01,812
Ene Ranma maitea.

254
00:17:04,815 --> 00:17:07,818
Gaur zure bikotea izango naiz.

255
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:15,325
Elkarrekin sartuko gara
benetako maitasunaren ringean.

256
00:17:18,912 --> 00:17:21,540
Ranmak sukarra dauka ala?

257
00:17:21,623 --> 00:17:23,250
Nor zara zu?

258
00:17:23,834 --> 00:17:27,546
Bikotekide praktikantea
eta beste neska horren ordezkaria.

259
00:17:28,213 --> 00:17:30,591
Gure armoniak
maitasunaren melodia konposatuko du.

260
00:17:30,674 --> 00:17:32,551
Jo dezagun zure arimaren gonga…

261
00:17:32,634 --> 00:17:35,554
Nondik atera dituzu
esaldi lotsagarri horiek?

262
00:17:35,637 --> 00:17:37,347
Zer arraio, Akane?

263
00:17:37,431 --> 00:17:39,808
Ez al zen bi nesken arteko zita bat?

264
00:17:39,892 --> 00:17:43,145
Mutilak itzelak direla
erakutsi nahi diot Tsubasari.

265
00:17:43,228 --> 00:17:46,899
- Eta behin ikusi duenean, e?
- Zurekin ere ligatzen saiatu da.

266
00:17:46,982 --> 00:17:48,150
Itxaron.

267
00:17:48,233 --> 00:17:50,444
Entzun. Ez sartu, konforme?

268
00:17:50,527 --> 00:17:51,945
Baina, baina…

269
00:17:52,029 --> 00:17:55,032
Tira, hatz txikiak lotuko ditugu.

270
00:17:55,115 --> 00:17:56,784
Zer txorakeria mota da hori?

271
00:17:56,867 --> 00:18:00,162
Hastera doa
maitasunez betetako ihesbide bidaia.

272
00:18:00,245 --> 00:18:02,081
Astuna zara. Utzi bakean.

273
00:18:02,164 --> 00:18:05,918
Taupada urduri bat
erakarpenaren seinale da. Tira, goazen…

274
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:08,670
Itxi ahoa. Ez arnastu. Ez hitz egin.

275
00:18:08,754 --> 00:18:10,672
Geldi, lapurrak!

276
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:14,718
Nola ausartzen zarete!

277
00:18:18,138 --> 00:18:19,139
Miau?

278
00:18:20,682 --> 00:18:23,519
Katuak!

279
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:32,361
- Baina…
- Itxaron.

280
00:18:32,986 --> 00:18:37,324
Sekula santan ez dut…

281
00:18:37,991 --> 00:18:42,412
interes txikiena ere izan…

282
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:46,875
gizon bat besarkatzeko! Ergela!

283
00:18:46,959 --> 00:18:49,086
Ai, dena bueltaka ari da.

284
00:18:49,169 --> 00:18:51,255
Kaixo… agur.

285
00:18:55,884 --> 00:18:58,011
Gizonei gorroto bizia die.

286
00:18:58,095 --> 00:19:02,015
Ondo merezita duzu.
Gizon bat ni ukitzen ausartzea ere…

287
00:19:04,893 --> 00:19:06,395
Ranma maitea?

288
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:07,479
Bai…

289
00:19:08,772 --> 00:19:10,858
Nork egin dizu hori?

290
00:19:10,941 --> 00:19:12,484
Egia esango diot?

291
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,820
Sendatu behar zaituzte.

292
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:15,988
Nireak egin du.

293
00:19:16,071 --> 00:19:18,907
Ranma maitea, ez izan horren ahula.

294
00:19:18,991 --> 00:19:22,953
Azken bainu bat hartu nahi nuke
mundu hau utzi baino lehen.

295
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:24,955
Bainu bat? Konforme.

296
00:19:25,038 --> 00:19:27,332
TENDÔ DOJOA

297
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:33,630
Zer ondo, bainu bat arratsalde erdian.

298
00:19:37,301 --> 00:19:38,760
Ieup!

299
00:19:47,895 --> 00:19:49,980
Ranma maitea, zer moduz?

300
00:19:50,814 --> 00:19:51,857
Kaixo?

301
00:19:54,818 --> 00:19:57,070
Lehengo gizona zara?

302
00:19:57,154 --> 00:19:59,907
Halaxe da.

303
00:20:01,074 --> 00:20:02,075
Ezin liteke.

304
00:20:02,743 --> 00:20:05,412
Ene Ranma maitea mutil bat da.

305
00:20:08,916 --> 00:20:11,877
Banekien Akane zela daukadan guztia.

306
00:20:12,461 --> 00:20:14,796
Eraso!

307
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:18,759
Aski da.
Akabo emakumeen atzetik ibiltzeari.

308
00:20:18,842 --> 00:20:21,386
- Zergatik gorroto dituzu gizonak?
- Askatu.

309
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:22,930
Ixo!

310
00:20:25,766 --> 00:20:28,185
Zertarako galdu denbora gizonekin?

311
00:20:28,268 --> 00:20:31,396
Neska polit batekin ibili nahi dut!

312
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,481
Zer?

313
00:20:34,524 --> 00:20:37,402
Gizon bat biluzik
ikusten duzun lehen aldia da?

314
00:20:37,486 --> 00:20:39,196
Arraioa.

315
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:41,657
Egin dudan guztia

316
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:44,785
zu bezalako alproja batengatik egin dut?

317
00:20:46,995 --> 00:20:48,872
- Gizonezkoen eskola?
- Bai.

318
00:20:49,456 --> 00:20:52,960
Ez nizuen esan lehengo eskola
gizonezkoentzat baino ez zela?

319
00:20:53,043 --> 00:20:54,461
Ideiarik ere ez nuen.

320
00:20:54,544 --> 00:20:56,463
Guztiz engainatu nau.

321
00:20:57,005 --> 00:20:59,132
Engainatu? Mesedez.

322
00:20:59,216 --> 00:21:01,885
Mozorrotzea gogoko duen
mutil arrunta naiz.

323
00:21:01,969 --> 00:21:05,389
Inork ez zidan galdetu
eta bazenekitela uste nuen.

324
00:21:05,472 --> 00:21:07,391
Nola nahi zenuten jakitea?

325
00:21:07,474 --> 00:21:09,351
Bazenu esatea, aizu!

326
00:21:09,434 --> 00:21:10,852
Ez haserretu nirekin.

327
00:21:10,936 --> 00:21:13,355
Azken finean, hobby bera dugu, ezta?

328
00:21:13,438 --> 00:21:16,066
<i>Hobby bera dugu, ezta?</i>

329
00:21:16,733 --> 00:21:20,862
Ez horixe! Nire kasuan ez da hobbya!

330
00:21:28,662 --> 00:21:31,999
Eraso, eraso, eraso!

331
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:02,005
Azpitituluak: Loinaz C. A.

